**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/.artifacts/
*.trx
*.user
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib
*.log
*.tmp
*.cache
*.pyc
__pycache__/
reshade-cache/
screenshots/
Payload/
